WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.583
Hi, this is a quick tour of the Touchline app that Tim has put together to support

2
00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:14.203
all of us.

3
00:00:14.203 --> 00:00:19.223
(Not really, it's making Tim and Deano's life easier.) This, with the help of AI.

4
00:00:19.223 --> 00:00:24.740
Don't worry Ray, it won't take over your bank account, but I can see your search history.

5
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.289
Shocking Catty, shocking!

6
00:00:27.403 --> 00:00:28.256
So what is it?

7
00:00:28.256 --> 00:00:32.585
It's one place for everything to do with the U15 Blues: kick off times,

8
00:00:32.585 --> 00:00:37.158
where to be and when, lifts, photos, events, and a say in Man of the Match.

9
00:00:37.158 --> 00:00:38.255
Why did I make it?

10
00:00:38.255 --> 00:00:39.170
To help us all.

11
00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:43.986
Things get lost on WhatsApp, and things can change pretty quickly on match day.

12
00:00:43.986 --> 00:00:48.376
This lets me update you fast, and the alerts will ping up on your phone.

13
00:00:48.376 --> 00:00:50.632
Nothing on it is a mark or a ranking.

14
00:00:50.632 --> 00:00:55.387
And if there's something I've missed that you think would be a great addition,

15
00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:58.192
or something you think should go, let me know.

16
00:00:58.192 --> 00:01:00.082
I want this to work for us all.

17
00:01:01.218 --> 00:01:05.799
You will have been sent an email and a WhatsApp message with your code and your

18
00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:07.017
lad's code to log in.

19
00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:12.273
Let's start with the family page.

20
00:01:12.273 --> 00:01:16.035
The first time you open it, you will see a privacy screen.

21
00:01:16.035 --> 00:01:20.704
It tells you plainly what we keep about your family, and what we do not.

22
00:01:20.704 --> 00:01:23.427
No scores, no ratings, no medical details.

23
00:01:23.427 --> 00:01:26.799
Have a read, then tap the yellow button to carry on.

24
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.225
This is the Home tab.

25
00:01:31.225 --> 00:01:36.588
At the top you get one point to focus on from me, then your next game: kick off time,

26
00:01:36.588 --> 00:01:39.932
when to be there, the postcode, and any parking tips.

27
00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:45.547
Directions and Waze open your maps app, so you can check live traffic before you set off.

28
00:01:46.694 --> 00:01:51.334
Still on the Home page there is a short guide to your lad's job in the team,

29
00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:56.584
some football brain questions, and a few thoughts for after the game and for game day.

30
00:01:56.584 --> 00:01:59.453
Your own lad's photo and nickname sit here too.

31
00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:02.811
You only ever see your own player, never anyone else's.

32
00:02:05.911 --> 00:02:08.841
The Games tab lists every fixture and result.

33
00:02:08.841 --> 00:02:12.422
Each game has directions and an add to calendar button,

34
00:02:12.422 --> 00:02:15.027
and you can offer a lift or ask for one.

35
00:02:15.027 --> 00:02:18.998
Any address you type for a lift is only seen by me and Deano.

36
00:02:22.111 --> 00:02:26.069
Events is for team nights, fundraisers and anything else going on.

37
00:02:26.069 --> 00:02:31.106
Media is where team photos and match pictures will appear, once I have checked them.

38
00:02:31.106 --> 00:02:35.904
If a picture has your lad in it and you would rather it came down, just tell me.

39
00:02:37.055 --> 00:02:38.756
Got something for the team?

40
00:02:38.756 --> 00:02:43.545
Go to Events, tap Add an event, and fill in the title, date, time and place.

41
00:02:43.545 --> 00:02:45.435
Pop a link in if there is one.

42
00:02:45.435 --> 00:02:47.514
It doesn't go live straight away.

43
00:02:47.514 --> 00:02:51.736
It waits for me or Deano to check it, then it appears for everyone.

44
00:02:54.844 --> 00:02:59.454
When I open voting, you will see Man of the Match on your Home page.

45
00:02:59.454 --> 00:03:01.421
It's one vote for one player.

46
00:03:01.421 --> 00:03:06.709
Not your own lad, and vote for effort, attitude and team play, not just goals.

47
00:03:06.709 --> 00:03:11.997
Player of the Season works differently: you pick your first, second and third.

48
00:03:11.997 --> 00:03:15.115
Until I open voting, it just says it's closed.

49
00:03:18.215 --> 00:03:19.665
Now the important one.

50
00:03:19.665 --> 00:03:23.685
If I need to tell you a game is off, or kick off has changed,

51
00:03:23.685 --> 00:03:25.992
I will send an alert to your phone.

52
00:03:25.992 --> 00:03:28.232
You need to switch it on yourself.

53
00:03:28.232 --> 00:03:34.098
Find the Match day alerts card and tap Turn on alerts, then say yes when your phone asks.

54
00:03:37.197 --> 00:03:38.351
Stuck on something?

55
00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:43.514
Tap Quick help at the bottom of any page and type your question the way you'd say it,

56
00:03:43.514 --> 00:03:45.518
like "I need a lift on Saturday".

57
00:03:45.518 --> 00:03:47.705
You'll get the answer straight away.

58
00:03:47.705 --> 00:03:52.078
And if you want to ask me and Deano something, or tell us about an idea,

59
00:03:52.078 --> 00:03:54.386
tap Ask the coaches on your Home page.

60
00:03:54.386 --> 00:03:56.208
We'll answer you on that page.

61
00:03:56.208 --> 00:03:59.245
If it's urgent, the Contacts page has our details.

62
00:04:02.344 --> 00:04:03.882
Now the bit for your lad.

63
00:04:03.882 --> 00:04:09.170
On the Home page he taps Start, picks a nickname, his stronger foot and his positions,

64
00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:11.875
then rates himself on the things we work on.

65
00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:16.856
It takes about three minutes, and it helps Deano and me plan sessions to help him

66
00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:20.545
develop the skills, abilities and understanding of the game,

67
00:04:20.545 --> 00:04:22.697
and what we are asking of the lads.

68
00:04:22.697 --> 00:04:25.096
It is his own view, not a mark from us.

69
00:04:25.096 --> 00:04:27.740
The lads also get a page called Your voice,

70
00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:32.228
where they can share ideas and ask us questions without their name on it.

71
00:04:35.344 --> 00:04:40.897
To add this to your phone as an app, if your phone hasn't already offered to install it:

72
00:04:40.897 --> 00:04:43.989
on an iPhone, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen.

73
00:04:43.989 --> 00:04:47.081
On Android, tap the three dots, then Install app.

74
00:04:47.081 --> 00:04:52.255
If anything looks wrong, or you want something corrected or deleted, just tell me.

75
00:04:52.255 --> 00:04:57.493
This is what happens when United get beat 4-1 and training and games get cancelled.

76
00:04:57.493 --> 00:04:59.575
I get bored and mess with things.

77
00:04:59.575 --> 00:05:02.730
Please take the time to have a play round with it.

78
00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.497
Thanks for all your support.

